    "body": "Addressed the follow-up review findings for Issue #16.\r\n\r\n- Hardened the Ticket Detail attachment layout so long removal reasons wrap safely on mobile without horizontal overflow.\r\n- Kept the Ticket Detail header aligned with the UI specification by showing the required creation date only, and styled Summary as large read-only text.\r\n- Consolidated shared ticket priority/status types and the date-time formatter used by My Tickets, Ticket Detail, and Badge components.\r\n- Removed reviewer-record updates that belong to other Lab 2 issues, keeping this PR focused on the Requester Ticket Detail API and UI.\r\n\r\nThe Ticket Detail flow continues to preserve read-only behavior, ownership-safe error states, attachment audit metadata, and responsive layouts.",
